# EndraHome app shortcuts -- stable config for Run010 and newer.
# Place this file beside your EndraHome .tns executable in Documents.
# Format: slot=Label|/documents/folder/Program.tns
# Empty path disables shortcut; apps remain independent programs.
# If upgrading, KEEP your existing configured paths by copying your older
# Apps007/Apps009 file and renaming that copy to this permanent filename.
0=EndraGBA|
1=EndraZIP|
2=EndraCmd|
3=Files|
4=Images|
5=Tools|
6=Favorites|
